### Exercises: Exact Printed Data, No Solutions

Small-question labels are Cyrillic by the binding soviet-cn transcription convention.
The pixels of а/е alone cannot distinguish them from Latin a/e; distinct б/в/г/д
and the printed sequence support that convention, not author text.

665 (220 y~2740-3020, 221 y~290-355):
利用函数 y=10^x 的图象(参看图82):
а) 设变量 x 的值等于 0.1, 0.25, 0.72, 0.865，求式 10^x 的值。
б) 设式 10^x 的值等于 3, 5, 6.2, 9.37，求变量 x 的值。

666 (221 y~410-700), three lines:
