д) 10^{-3.06}.

669 (221 y~1430-1710), three lines:
设10乘方的结果等于：
а) 1.5; б) 3.7; в) 6.8; г) 8.8.
利用函数 y=10^x 的图象，求出10的幂指数。

670 (221 y~1760-2280), five lines:
把下列已知数当中的每一个数都表示成底数为10的幂
(如果需要的话，可以利用函数 y=10^x 的图象):
а) 1, 10, 10000, 0.1, 0.001; б) 7, 70, 0.7, 0.007;
в) 3.8, 380, 0.38, 0.038;
г) 5.2, 200, 0.52, 0.0052.
The second value of г is visibly 200, NOT 520. Do not "repair" it by pattern.

Printed heading (221 y~2420): 复习题.

671 (221 y~2560-2840), three lines:
把下列各式写成底数为10的幂：
а) sqrt(10); б) cube_root(100); в) 10 sqrt(10);
г) 0.1 sqrt(0.1); д) 0.1 cube_root(10); е) 100 fourth_root(10^{-3}).
The radical in е covers 10^{-3}, including the exponent; no extra exponent outside.

672 (221 y~2890-3050; 222 y~340-410), three lines across two pages:
解下列方程：
а) 10^{1-x^2}=1; б) sqrt(100^x)=0.1; в) (0.01)^x=1000;
г) 10^{3-2x}=10^{x^2}; д) (0.01)^x=cube_root(10); е) 1000^x=fifth_root(100).
Native crop 7 confirms the exponent x^2 on the right of г.
Native crop 7 confirms index 5 in е; the dark mark above 5 is not another index.
б's radical bar visibly covers the raised x of 100^x; do not move x outside the root.

673 (222 y~460-860), four lines:
求下列不等式的解集合：
а) (0.1)^x>10; б) 10^{x+1}<10000; в) 10^{x-2}>0.01;
г) 0.1⩽10^x⩽10000; д) 1<10^{x+1}<10000;
е) 0.01<100^x<sqrt(10).
г is inclusive on BOTH sides; д/е are strict on BOTH sides.
The final base is 100, not 10.

674 (222 y~910-1260), three lines:
解下列方程和不等式：
а) 8^{x-3}=16; б) 27^{2x-1}=9;
в) 12^x<cube_root(144); г) 0.4^x<15 5/8.
The last RHS is the mixed number fifteen and five eighths, not 15×5/8.

