## Phase1 Substantive Status and Genuine Holds

PASS: source text/data observations, exercise boundaries and source-object inventory
above are frozen independently. This is NOT yet a verdict on author files.
HOLD: exact modern geometry remains unverified: short edge-strip fractions,
individual grid skew, arrow apex coordinates, full curve control points and dash
segment/gap geometry. Pixel bands are approximations, not executable exact geometry.
A later image author must distinguish source values, scan estimates and deliberate
modern regularization; must map all grid/point requirements to explicit assertions.
Do not use an author FigureSpec/template as truth or treat deterministic output as fidelity.
No native execution count, line reconciliation result or tool exit status approves
source transcription. Phase2 must compare the actual author bytes to this freeze.
